      { q: 'A question asks "Why was Tom nervous?" — what keyword should you search for in the passage?', opts: ['"Tom"', '"nervous"', '"Why"', '"was"'], ans: 1, exp: '"nervous" 是情感关键词，在文章里找这个词附近的原因句' }
